-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Step 2 -&nbsp;</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><strong dir=\"ltr\">Head to My Admin &gt; Bookkeeping &gt; Client Dashboard &gt; Bank Feeds</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click Link Bank Account</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:559px;height:478px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9147625518/original/SPEo-jC5ZOkq5ozQwquA-9njAaIhSvV_DQ.png?1640099018\" width=\"559\" height=\"478\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9147625518\"></span></span><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">The following pop up will show.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Select the bank account you would like to connect from the dropdown menu</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Then click the check box to agree to the terms and conditions.</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Click next.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:602px;height:391px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9147625678/original/yqSq-wGFcY-ehsy3krxyY-zDVxJWb7cbtQ.png?1640099097\" width=\"602\" height=\"391\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9147625678\"></span></span></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">You will get redirected to the following page,</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please select your bank from the photos or search your bank name.</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">All UK banks are supported apart from Metro bank</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:602px;height:696px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9147625951/original/pNAinJmNyCYl77dzlitOqRzcUAUVd48sRQ.png?1640099231\" width=\"602\" height=\"696\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9147625951\"></span></span><br></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please give Truelayer permission to access the bank account</span></span></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-weight: 400;\"><span style=\"border:none;display:inline-block;overflow:hidden;width:602px;height:689px;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9147626084/original/WWasB1ongpYHvVFW3QKryk5BzbhJRnbj_A.png?1640099288\" width=\"602\" height=\"689\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dii\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9147626084\"></span></span></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Please enter in the bank details as needed</span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: Helvetica,sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16